WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 3=

01:55.933 --> 01:57.060
What do you want to eat?

01:58.340 --> 01:59.300
You.

02:00.580 --> 02:01.820
Too greasy. I don't eat that.

02:01.940 --> 02:02.755
Let's have porridge.

02:08.660 --> 02:10.100
Why did you wipe it off?

02:10.420 --> 02:11.380
Allergy. It's itchy.

02:12.311 --> 02:13.733
Then, I'll draw another one for you.

02:14.500 --> 02:15.180
No...

02:15.580 --> 02:16.820
It'll affect driving safety.

02:29.620 --> 02:30.780
Is what He Han said true?

02:32.020 --> 02:32.420
Yes.

02:32.777 --> 02:34.444
When were you planning to tell me?

02:34.740 --> 02:35.460
In a week

02:35.900 --> 02:36.580
or a month.

02:36.955 --> 02:38.940
When you're ready,
either you leave, or I leave.

02:38.940 --> 02:39.580
Why?

02:40.220 --> 02:41.780
Is there a problem at work?

02:49.620 --> 02:50.180
Marry me.

02:51.955 --> 02:53.800
This is the second time
I'm proposing to you.

02:53.940 --> 02:55.200
Well, this is my second answer.

02:55.420 --> 02:57.100
Dating and marriage are not my thing.

02:57.940 --> 02:58.780
If you say yes,

02:59.900 --> 03:00.820
I'll dump Zhao Lanxin.

03:01.700 --> 03:02.820
We can run Chenxing together.

03:03.133 --> 03:04.460
Otherwise, I really don't have

03:04.580 --> 03:05.888
a reason to stay and help you.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.733
Our share percentages
are almost the same.

03:07.740 --> 03:09.577
When we make money,
you don't get less than I do.

03:09.600 --> 03:10.933
How did it become you helping me?

03:11.000 --> 03:12.600
I'm helping you
get out of He Han's shadow.

03:12.644 --> 03:13.820
I don't see any shadow,

03:13.911 --> 03:15.822
and I don't need you
to help me get out of one.

03:15.980 --> 03:16.820
If there is a shadow,

03:17.060 --> 03:18.460
it's in your own heart.

03:18.620 --> 03:19.500
You can act tough,

03:19.500 --> 03:20.540
but everyone saw

03:20.540 --> 03:21.688
He Han's attitude toward you.

03:22.580 --> 03:24.420
I admit he's a genius in some ways,

03:24.540 --> 03:26.511
but that doesn't change
the fact that he's a jerk.

03:26.733 --> 03:27.780
Do you really want to keep

03:27.780 --> 03:29.755
thinking about him
every day at work and after work?

03:29.822 --> 03:30.577
There's no need.

03:31.660 --> 03:32.140
I don't.

03:32.460 --> 03:34.620
Every day, you shout
that you want to take down He Han.

03:34.620 --> 03:36.577
Does that mean you're invincible
and untouchable?

03:36.666 --> 03:38.622
The more you act like this,
the more it proves

03:38.630 --> 03:39.820
you simply can't get past

03:39.820 --> 03:41.220
the hurdle He Han left you with.

03:48.355 --> 03:49.911
Since He Han is important to me,

03:49.977 --> 03:51.090
I was not afraid when he left.

03:51.100 --> 03:51.733
If you leave,

03:52.740 --> 03:53.540
I care even less.

04:31.660 --> 04:32.500
Hello, Lawyer Zhang,

04:32.577 --> 04:34.460
could you please
help me contact Lawyer Bei?

04:34.470 --> 04:36.050
I have something urgent
to discuss with him.

04:36.088 --> 04:36.977
He's in a meeting?

04:37.660 --> 04:38.060
Then,

04:38.540 --> 04:40.060
can I come by at noon to see him?

04:42.911 --> 04:44.200
Okay, thank you.

04:53.180 --> 04:53.780
Hello, Mei.

04:53.977 --> 04:55.555
Something happened at my company.

04:55.644 --> 04:57.230
Help me set up
a meeting with Lawyer Bei.

04:58.380 --> 04:58.860
Go ahead.

05:06.020 --> 05:06.980
Okay, no problem.

05:29.020 --> 05:29.500
Zhanqiao,

05:30.060 --> 05:30.460
hello.

05:30.800 --> 05:32.980
Sorry, Mr. Bei, for asking you out
on such short notice.

05:33.180 --> 05:33.580
Sit.

05:38.288 --> 05:39.260
Mei has already told me

05:39.420 --> 05:40.660
about your situation.

05:41.260 --> 05:42.620
It's not a very complicated issue.

05:42.780 --> 05:44.260
You all eat in peace

05:44.555 --> 05:45.940
and then go to work as usual.

05:46.300 --> 05:47.380
As for Hong Qigong,

05:47.460 --> 05:49.444
I've already asked
Zhang Yousen to go there.

05:50.380 --> 05:52.300
He's the Lawyer Zhang
who answered your call.

05:52.820 --> 05:54.540
He's my student and also my assistant.

05:56.140 --> 05:57.660
The story idea and concept

05:58.180 --> 05:59.420
have not yet been written down,

05:59.533 --> 06:02.050
so they were all discussed
verbally between Hong Qigong,

06:02.088 --> 06:04.355
the editorial assistant,
and me during planning meetings.

06:04.622 --> 06:06.777
Now, if Hong Qigong
wants to leave, that's fine,

06:06.860 --> 06:08.020
but this thing isn't hers.

06:08.422 --> 06:09.866
She can't take it with her.

06:10.060 --> 06:11.820
You must have meeting records,

06:11.900 --> 06:13.260
or recordings, or something, right?

06:13.860 --> 06:15.900
If you do, give them to Zhang Yousen.

06:16.060 --> 06:17.300
After he meets Hong Qigong,

06:17.460 --> 06:18.740
he'll report back to me.

06:19.100 --> 06:20.220
If there are any issues,

06:20.300 --> 06:21.260
I'll follow up in time.

06:25.860 --> 06:27.420
I still have a client waiting upstairs.

06:27.620 --> 06:29.060
Take your time eating. I'll go first.

06:29.940 --> 06:30.770
Thank you.

06:30.770 --> 06:31.180
Alright.

06:33.220 --> 06:34.500
The firm will cover this bill.

06:35.333 --> 06:37.230
You don't need to worry
after you finish eating.

06:40.860 --> 06:41.300
Goodbye.

06:47.222 --> 06:48.820
How did you manage to get him here?

06:49.700 --> 06:50.700
His assistant said

06:50.700 --> 06:51.820
he was busy in a meeting.

06:51.955 --> 06:54.133
Even if someone is busy,
it depends on who it's for.

06:54.177 --> 06:56.333
For some people, they don't
even have time to look at you.

06:56.340 --> 06:58.490
For others, they'll fly around
the world for three days

06:58.500 --> 07:00.355
and still report to you
morning and night.

07:00.720 --> 07:02.066
What's your relationship with him?

07:02.260 --> 07:03.540
My company is his client.

07:04.700 --> 07:06.300
He has a wife and kids, you know?

07:06.580 --> 07:07.180
I know.

07:07.777 --> 07:08.980
Just because he has a family,

07:09.220 --> 07:10.380
does that mean we can't talk?

07:12.340 --> 07:14.100
I can tell exactly what you're thinking.

07:14.555 --> 07:16.333
Don't make the same mistake again.

07:17.180 --> 07:18.940
I wouldn't dare cross the line.

07:20.660 --> 07:21.460
He likes you?

07:21.860 --> 07:23.420
There are plenty of men who like me.

07:23.533 --> 07:25.022
So, it means you're leading him on.

07:25.180 --> 07:26.020
You...

07:26.133 --> 07:28.688
Just because I'm good-looking,
that means I'm leading him on?

07:28.820 --> 07:29.980
You asked me to set this up.

07:29.980 --> 07:30.820
I got him here for you,

07:30.820 --> 07:31.820
and now you're nitpicking.

07:31.820 --> 07:32.911
What's wrong with you?

07:33.420 --> 07:34.700
I'm reminding you.

07:35.088 --> 07:37.600
If there's a problem, fix it.
If not, stay alert.

07:39.740 --> 07:40.220
Hello.

07:41.555 --> 07:42.733
I won't stay for the meal.

07:42.844 --> 07:45.222
I'll come find you tonight
to follow up on the progress.

07:45.380 --> 07:46.644
You're in such a hurry?

07:46.777 --> 07:48.533
Li Weifeng's wife will come to see me.

07:50.820 --> 07:52.180
You should be careful, then.

07:52.860 --> 07:54.140
How about I go with you?

07:54.540 --> 07:54.940
It's fine.

07:55.820 --> 07:57.420
I'm going to save her marriage.

07:57.700 --> 07:58.900
She should be thanking me.

07:59.020 --> 08:00.060
With the face of yours,

08:00.380 --> 08:02.044
you can't save anyone's marriage.

08:02.460 --> 08:04.466
It's already good enough
if you don't ruin it.

08:05.020 --> 08:06.100
Don't make things worse.

08:09.460 --> 08:11.500
I dislike and pity

08:12.020 --> 08:13.740
a woman like Li Weifeng's wife.

08:15.820 --> 08:16.900
She reminds me of my mother.

08:47.340 --> 08:48.220
Hello, Lawyer Zhang.

08:49.200 --> 08:50.644
You went to see Hong Qigong?

08:51.820 --> 08:52.180
Get lost!

08:53.060 --> 08:53.850
Ms. Hong.

08:53.850 --> 08:55.380
Ms. Hong, wait! Please, Ms. Hong.

08:58.260 --> 08:58.980
Ms. Hong.

08:59.060 --> 09:00.540
You've misunderstood me, Ms. Hong.

09:06.020 --> 09:06.780
Ms. Hong.

09:17.540 --> 09:18.380
Ms. Hong?

09:22.740 --> 09:23.740
Ms. Hong Qigong.

09:24.460 --> 09:25.460
Lin.

09:27.620 --> 09:29.460
Editor-in-Chief Lin,

09:30.700 --> 09:32.340
you've disappointed me.

09:33.380 --> 09:35.060
You've hurt me, you know?

09:35.860 --> 09:37.020
I'm sorry, Ms. Hong.

09:37.020 --> 09:38.860
You sent such a young lawyer

09:38.860 --> 09:39.900
to talk to me about this.

09:41.420 --> 09:42.820
You're looking down on me.

09:44.500 --> 09:46.540
Who told you I wasn't renewing with you?

09:47.180 --> 09:48.660
Even if someone told you,

09:48.780 --> 09:50.820
shouldn't you have come to ask me first?

09:51.300 --> 09:53.460
Who is it that you choose to believe,

09:53.860 --> 09:55.020
or is it that you

09:55.020 --> 09:57.780
do not even trust me at all?

09:58.180 --> 09:59.180
I was wrong.

09:59.288 --> 10:00.300
I believed too easily.

10:00.300 --> 10:00.900
Ms. Hong.

10:01.980 --> 10:02.780
Coming.

10:02.955 --> 10:03.900
Are you here, Ms. Hong?

10:03.900 --> 10:05.300
Coming.

10:07.580 --> 10:08.740
Mr. Chen, right?

10:09.420 --> 10:10.660
Come, I'm upstairs.

10:10.680 --> 10:11.740
I'll come down and get you.

10:11.740 --> 10:13.244
This place is a bit hard to find, huh?

10:13.288 --> 10:14.355
Watch your step.

10:14.540 --> 10:15.900
The stairway is a bit narrow.

10:15.977 --> 10:16.930
You're upstairs, right?

10:16.930 --> 10:17.620
Coming.

10:20.311 --> 10:21.580
- Ms. Hong.
- Mr. Chen, right?

10:21.800 --> 10:23.620
I've already prepared
everything for you.

10:23.620 --> 10:23.980
Right?

10:25.100 --> 10:25.660
Come.

10:25.844 --> 10:27.540
- We've been waiting for you.
- Alright.

10:27.900 --> 10:29.180
Hu sent me.

10:30.940 --> 10:32.140
A friend of Hu

10:32.300 --> 10:33.860
is a friend of mine.

10:34.860 --> 10:35.780
Come, come.

10:36.300 --> 10:38.380
Everything's ready for you.

10:38.980 --> 10:39.580
It's this one.

10:40.020 --> 10:40.580
Take a look.

10:40.940 --> 10:41.555
Alright.

10:42.620 --> 10:43.940
Let me pour you some tea.

10:44.740 --> 10:45.980
The price is negotiable.

10:46.380 --> 10:47.260
Okay, thank you.

10:47.420 --> 10:48.660
Here, have some tea.

10:49.940 --> 10:50.460
Good tea.

10:51.460 --> 10:53.940
This should be top-grade Laobanzhang.

10:55.244 --> 10:55.700
Thank you.

10:55.700 --> 10:56.340
Take your time.

10:56.660 --> 10:57.140
Alright.

11:04.340 --> 11:07.260
My novels are written for young readers,

11:07.780 --> 11:10.340
but I'm an old-school woman.

11:11.260 --> 11:12.540
Trust, you know?

11:13.060 --> 11:16.420
Trust is the foundation
of long-term cooperation.

11:16.900 --> 11:19.180
You're one of
the top editors in the industry.

11:19.380 --> 11:20.780
Your track record speaks for itself.

11:21.660 --> 11:22.180
As for me,

11:22.820 --> 11:24.980
I'm not some newcomer either, alright?

11:25.900 --> 11:27.940
Those story proposals
you are worried about...

11:28.260 --> 11:29.980
I will not touch what is yours.

11:30.940 --> 11:31.420
Ms. Hong,

11:31.488 --> 11:33.377
can I take a look
at your other materials?

11:33.380 --> 11:34.620
Go ahead.

11:34.860 --> 11:35.970
Everything's negotiable.

11:35.970 --> 11:36.460
Alright.

11:37.500 --> 11:39.180
Since I've said this much,

11:39.660 --> 11:41.260
I'll be even more direct.

11:42.700 --> 11:44.380
If you think

11:44.380 --> 11:46.260
I can't beat He Han on the rankings,

11:46.333 --> 11:48.200
and that's why
you're putting on this act,

11:48.300 --> 11:50.220
then there's no need
to beat around the bush.

11:51.220 --> 11:52.860
Whoever you think can beat him,

11:53.140 --> 11:54.940
just let them do it.

11:55.540 --> 11:55.980
Alright?

11:56.420 --> 11:57.060
That's it.

11:57.222 --> 11:58.422
I have business to attend to.

11:58.460 --> 11:59.244
Please leave.

11:59.820 --> 12:00.580
Come on.

12:21.133 --> 12:22.530
Hello, Sir. Everything's ready.

12:22.540 --> 12:23.300
Here, thank you.

12:23.377 --> 12:24.622
Alright, thank you, Sir.

12:31.088 --> 12:32.580
Where are you? I'm outside your room.

12:32.733 --> 12:33.688
I need to talk to you.

12:33.755 --> 12:34.460
I'm not there.

12:34.460 --> 12:35.180
Didn't I tell you

12:35.180 --> 12:36.620
I moved across from your company?

13:02.500 --> 13:03.140
Lin Zhanqiao.

13:04.288 --> 13:05.044
I'm Dai Shan.

13:05.420 --> 13:05.780
Hello.

13:06.900 --> 13:08.220
The first time I heard about you

13:08.220 --> 13:10.500
was when you left the publishing house.

13:10.644 --> 13:12.288
I submitted my resume to you before.

13:12.377 --> 13:13.288
You didn't hire me.

13:14.220 --> 13:16.780
For someone this pretty,
I wouldn't dare.

13:17.900 --> 13:19.300
That's judging by appearance.

13:20.466 --> 13:22.210
He Han is at the cafe
on the second floor,

13:22.220 --> 13:23.940
meeting with platform executives.

13:24.355 --> 13:26.222
If you go up,
you might have to wait a bit.

13:26.380 --> 13:26.900
No problem.

13:33.420 --> 13:34.500
You can wait here for now.

14:25.400 --> 14:26.860
- Come, I'll walk you out.
- Come.

14:26.860 --> 14:27.780
- Thank you.
- Alright.

14:29.380 --> 14:30.260
Ms. Lin, you're here.

14:30.420 --> 14:31.300
Come, have a seat.

14:31.860 --> 14:32.780
Another black coffee.

14:32.860 --> 14:33.660
Skim milk, no sugar.

14:33.900 --> 14:34.580
How did you know

14:34.580 --> 14:36.150
Hong Qigong was going
to sign with Zhao Lanxin?

14:36.180 --> 14:36.700
Just a guess.

14:37.100 --> 14:38.088
What, did you go see her?

14:38.180 --> 14:39.155
So she didn't sign?

14:39.340 --> 14:41.620
Good. Then keep working
with her and compete with me.

14:41.620 --> 14:43.422
Can you stop
pushing me to call you a jerk?

14:43.620 --> 14:44.420
You already did.

14:44.622 --> 14:46.200
You're not welcome at my company.

14:46.266 --> 14:47.340
Don't show up again.

14:47.420 --> 14:49.066
Your company is about to fall apart.

14:50.020 --> 14:51.180
Fine, I won't come to you.

14:51.311 --> 14:52.400
You don't come to me either.

14:52.460 --> 14:54.150
From now on, we stay out
of each other's business!

14:54.180 --> 14:55.460
If you have what it takes,
keep your number one spot.

14:55.460 --> 14:57.400
If I have what it takes,
my authors will surpass you.

14:57.420 --> 14:58.630
From now on, we let our work speak!

14:58.644 --> 14:59.733
No contact or interaction!

14:59.940 --> 15:00.800
Lin Zhanqiao, you can't

15:00.822 --> 15:02.860
even write better than I do,
and you're teaching others?

15:02.860 --> 15:04.060
Doesn't that make it even worse?

15:04.070 --> 15:05.330
Such a simple truth.
You don't get it?

15:05.340 --> 15:07.300
A good editor with a good author

15:07.300 --> 15:08.620
is one plus one greater than two.

15:08.688 --> 15:11.155
A great author alone
is already worth many times more.

15:11.900 --> 15:12.540
One day,

15:12.540 --> 15:13.900
you'll pay for your arrogance!

15:14.060 --> 15:15.380
Enjoy it while it lasts.

15:15.488 --> 15:16.888
The view from my room is amazing.

15:16.911 --> 15:17.860
Want to take a look?

15:17.860 --> 15:18.490
Not interested.

15:18.500 --> 15:19.140
Next time, then.

15:19.300 --> 15:20.300
We're so close anyway.

15:20.580 --> 15:21.800
Drop by when you have time.

15:30.644 --> 15:32.622
These were all given
to me by your husband.

15:32.640 --> 15:34.111
I'm returning everything to you today.

15:37.488 --> 15:38.580
This is what he sent me.

15:39.700 --> 15:40.660
As long as I agreed,

15:40.660 --> 15:42.311
he said he could
divorce you immediately.

15:42.940 --> 15:44.060
(Li Weifeng: You
received the bag, right?)

15:44.066 --> 15:44.700
(She has no taste.)

15:44.700 --> 15:45.860
(Only when I talk to you
do I feel a real connection.)

15:45.860 --> 15:47.060
(Zhou Mei: Your wife
misunderstood me before.)

15:47.060 --> 15:48.977
(Li Weifeng: You look
stunning today. I'm captivated.)

15:49.000 --> 15:49.820
(I truly like you.)

15:51.555 --> 15:53.022
You can keep deleting them.

15:59.155 --> 16:01.244
And you still say you
didn't seduce my husband?

16:01.355 --> 16:02.266
Before, I didn't.

16:02.900 --> 16:03.500
Now, I did.

16:05.580 --> 16:07.050
I just wanted to show you

16:07.050 --> 16:07.940
that if I wanted to,

16:08.088 --> 16:09.420
getting him to spend money on me

16:09.420 --> 16:10.300
or even divorce for me

16:10.300 --> 16:11.820
wouldn't be difficult at all.

16:12.822 --> 16:14.422
On the contrary, his obsession with love

16:14.488 --> 16:15.740
isn't something you can fix

16:15.740 --> 16:18.088
just by reporting me
and deleting our chat history.

16:19.340 --> 16:20.140
What do you want?

16:22.422 --> 16:24.260
What I can do
is stay away from your husband.

16:25.400 --> 16:27.222
But I'm not the one
you should be watching.

16:27.260 --> 16:28.620
You should be thanking me.

16:29.140 --> 16:30.140
With how eager he is,

16:30.200 --> 16:32.222
I've never once been interested in him.

16:37.100 --> 16:38.580
You can pay for this coffee today.

16:38.911 --> 16:40.755
I just saved your family a lot of money.

17:06.620 --> 17:07.260
Ms. Lin?

17:08.220 --> 17:08.620
Hello.

17:08.711 --> 17:11.022
I'm Zhang Yousen,
Assistant Lawyer to Lawyer Bei.

17:11.180 --> 17:11.780
Hello.

17:11.822 --> 17:13.866
Sorry about earlier.
It was a misunderstanding.

17:14.311 --> 17:15.780
I've already reported to Lawyer Bei.

17:15.940 --> 17:16.900
He asked me to follow up

17:16.900 --> 17:18.977
on the issue of
your executive leaving the company.

17:19.111 --> 17:20.180
Please thank him for me.

17:20.180 --> 17:21.422
He's been very thoughtful.

17:21.940 --> 17:22.860
If you don't mind,

17:22.870 --> 17:24.000
shall we go upstairs and talk?

17:24.380 --> 17:24.700
Sure.

17:31.620 --> 17:32.140
Ms. Lin,

17:32.244 --> 17:34.560
I have a general understanding
of your company's situation.

17:34.666 --> 17:35.580
Could you tell me more

17:35.580 --> 17:38.111
about your working relationship
with Ling Yikai and Zhao Lanxin?

17:39.660 --> 17:41.140
Ling Yikai is the Finance Director.

17:41.460 --> 17:42.940
Zhao Lanxin is a Senior Editor.

17:43.355 --> 17:45.733
The three of us
are partners in the company.

17:46.060 --> 17:47.140
I don't know why

17:47.140 --> 17:48.777
they suddenly brought up resigning.

17:49.100 --> 17:50.460
But since it's already happened,

17:50.900 --> 17:51.700
I'll accept it.

17:51.888 --> 17:53.220
What I care about are my authors

17:53.340 --> 17:55.066
and the projects currently in progress.

17:55.070 --> 17:56.050
If my authors stay, I stay.

17:56.050 --> 17:57.622
Any other difficulties, I can handle.

18:01.200 --> 18:02.000
Thank you.

18:04.180 --> 18:04.740
Have a seat.

18:09.460 --> 18:10.460
First,

18:10.700 --> 18:12.020
how to explain this externally?

18:12.820 --> 18:14.940
Second, how to divide the interests?

18:15.780 --> 18:17.340
Third, how will the company continue?

18:17.980 --> 18:18.577
Thank you.

18:19.340 --> 18:20.180
Worst-case scenario,

18:20.460 --> 18:21.980
Ling Yikai and Zhao Lanxin

18:22.088 --> 18:24.311
have already convinced
employees to resign together.

18:24.400 --> 18:26.555
They planned to leave
after the Chinese New Year,

18:26.644 --> 18:28.577
after collecting their year-end bonuses.

18:28.780 --> 18:29.540
Who knows,

18:29.700 --> 18:30.700
He Han made a sudden move

18:31.044 --> 18:32.422
and exposed things ahead of time?

18:32.980 --> 18:33.540
In theory,

18:34.660 --> 18:35.380
he also helped you

18:35.380 --> 18:36.660
save on year-end bonus expenses.

18:38.260 --> 18:39.420
Please tell Lawyer Bei

18:40.180 --> 18:42.260
that they cannot
take away any of my authors.

18:44.020 --> 18:44.860
Lawyer Bei asks

18:44.955 --> 18:47.577
if there's any chance to
resume cooperation with He Han.

18:47.620 --> 18:48.220
No chance.

18:50.100 --> 18:52.060
Not even a strategic partnership?

18:52.060 --> 18:52.420
No.

18:58.220 --> 18:58.980
Anyone

18:59.580 --> 19:00.460
but He Han.

19:01.100 --> 19:02.050
Without He Han,

19:02.050 --> 19:03.340
the rest don't mean much.

19:04.380 --> 19:05.660
I am Lin Zhanqiao.

19:06.220 --> 19:07.300
He Han is He Han.

19:08.180 --> 19:08.980
If every problem

19:08.980 --> 19:10.260
had the same solution,

19:10.980 --> 19:12.340
why would I go to Lawyer Bei?

19:12.420 --> 19:13.288
Don't you think?

19:20.780 --> 19:21.340
Sorry,

19:21.500 --> 19:23.200
I have an urgent matter to attend to.

19:25.140 --> 19:25.900
What happened?

19:26.333 --> 19:28.044
A friend of mine
was suddenly hospitalized.

19:28.140 --> 19:30.022
By the way,
she's also a client of your firm.

19:30.377 --> 19:31.300
I'll give you a ride.

19:31.700 --> 19:32.380
Thank you.

19:39.111 --> 19:40.511
Hello, may I ask where Zhou Mei is?

19:40.580 --> 19:41.220
I'm her friend.

19:41.700 --> 19:42.180
Over there.

19:42.620 --> 19:43.140
Thank you.

19:43.260 --> 19:44.066
You're welcome.

19:46.180 --> 19:47.540
How is she? Is it serious?

19:47.700 --> 19:49.060
She was pushed down the stairs.

19:49.300 --> 19:51.020
She has multiple soft tissue injuries

19:51.140 --> 19:52.377
and scratches on her face.

19:52.644 --> 19:54.333
These are her medical records and scans.

19:54.444 --> 19:55.220
Please keep them.

19:55.220 --> 19:55.933
Alright, thank you.

19:57.311 --> 19:58.888
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

19:59.180 --> 19:59.980
This kind of thing

19:59.980 --> 20:01.066
can cost a life, you know?

20:01.088 --> 20:03.000
How many lives do you have
to mess around like this?

20:03.340 --> 20:04.180
Who pushed you down?

20:04.444 --> 20:05.666
Was it Li Weifeng's wife?

20:05.820 --> 20:06.620
Not his wife.

20:07.260 --> 20:07.980
It was Li Weifeng.

20:09.380 --> 20:10.340
After I met his wife,

20:10.340 --> 20:11.420
I made things clear to him.

20:11.430 --> 20:12.490
I told him I have a boyfriend

20:12.500 --> 20:14.022
and that we should keep our distance.

20:14.220 --> 20:15.740
But he got very emotional

20:16.060 --> 20:17.140
and started pulling at me.

20:17.140 --> 20:19.460
Why did you show
our chat records to my wife?

20:21.180 --> 20:21.700
Zhou Mei!

20:21.844 --> 20:23.088
He accidentally pushed me down.

20:23.130 --> 20:24.620
Are you out of your mind?

20:25.300 --> 20:26.540
It had nothing to do with you,

20:26.540 --> 20:27.930
yet you insisted on saving
someone else's marriage

20:27.940 --> 20:29.250
and trying to "wake up" his wife?

20:29.260 --> 20:30.866
Look at what you've done to yourself!

20:30.900 --> 20:32.577
You're practically
getting yourself killed!

20:32.600 --> 20:33.860
When people like him lose control,

20:33.860 --> 20:35.140
they just need to vent it out.

20:35.300 --> 20:36.220
I know how this goes.

20:36.300 --> 20:37.020
Don't worry.

20:37.860 --> 20:39.500
Miss Zhou, do you need me? I'm a lawyer.

20:39.955 --> 20:41.620
She's reckless.
Stay out of her business.

20:41.740 --> 20:42.555
Heed my advice.

20:42.666 --> 20:44.733
Keep an eye on her.
If anything happens, call a nurse.

20:44.777 --> 20:45.733
I'll go get the medicine.

20:46.933 --> 20:48.955
If this happens again,
I won't come save you!

20:49.740 --> 20:50.620
One less troublemaker.

21:18.100 --> 21:19.260
Don't look at me like that.

21:20.180 --> 21:20.980
You're not my type.

21:30.820 --> 21:32.220
How are her injuries, Sir?

21:34.860 --> 21:36.220
Zhou Mei's condition

21:37.060 --> 21:38.220
is generally not serious.

21:38.620 --> 21:40.733
The injuries on her face
are only minor scratches.

21:41.700 --> 21:43.100
Most people in this situation

21:43.100 --> 21:44.111
won't be left with scars.

21:44.155 --> 21:45.660
But with certain skin types

21:45.820 --> 21:47.140
or unstable skin conditions,

21:47.200 --> 21:48.577
there might be some issues.

21:48.755 --> 21:50.333
But there can't be any chance of that.

21:50.500 --> 21:52.740
You can consider some
related treatment options.

21:53.100 --> 21:55.020
But these procedures
are not covered by insurance.

21:55.500 --> 21:56.020
That's fine.

21:56.180 --> 21:56.955
Let's do it.

22:02.540 --> 22:03.140
Careful.

22:13.620 --> 22:14.140
Careful.

22:19.700 --> 22:20.180
Inside.

22:22.340 --> 22:22.660
Here.

22:23.540 --> 22:23.940
Alright.

22:26.780 --> 22:27.580
Thank you.

22:27.700 --> 22:28.260
Careful.

22:31.180 --> 22:32.380
Actually, my leg is fine.

22:32.533 --> 22:33.860
The main injuries are on my hand.

22:35.140 --> 22:36.220
And your face.

22:36.900 --> 22:38.020
Just some scratches.

22:38.933 --> 22:41.044
Maybe skip
the cosmetic treatment. It's expensive.

22:41.660 --> 22:42.740
I've already paid.

22:42.740 --> 22:43.700
You have to go.

22:43.700 --> 22:45.022
Just think of it as skincare.

22:47.622 --> 22:48.977
Why are you still here?

22:50.688 --> 22:51.740
I have already written down

22:51.900 --> 22:53.130
the doctor's instructions for

22:53.130 --> 22:54.100
when and how to apply the medicine,

22:54.100 --> 22:55.377
as well as your next
follow-up appointment.

22:55.580 --> 22:56.060
Thank you.

22:57.177 --> 22:58.044
By the way,

22:58.177 --> 23:00.377
I have an appointment
with Lawyer Bei tomorrow at 9 AM.

23:00.380 --> 23:01.511
Can you come pick me up?

23:01.577 --> 23:02.177
Sure.

23:03.060 --> 23:04.650
You're already like this, and you still

23:04.660 --> 23:05.700
want to see Lawyer Bei?

23:06.500 --> 23:07.540
It's just a minor injury.

23:07.660 --> 23:08.580
It won't affect work.

23:09.100 --> 23:09.820
I'm leaving.

23:09.900 --> 23:11.222
You two get some rest.

23:15.780 --> 23:16.740
Thank you for today.

23:18.820 --> 23:19.180
Goodbye.

23:28.700 --> 23:29.580
Who's your boyfriend?

23:33.380 --> 23:34.140
I made it up.

23:35.300 --> 23:36.220
Isn't it Lawyer Bei?

23:37.340 --> 23:38.100
No.

23:38.844 --> 23:41.200
If you don't believe me,
I can show you the chat records.

23:41.420 --> 23:43.333
I don't even have
a situationship right now.

23:43.444 --> 23:45.022
I've been single for a year and a half.

23:45.300 --> 23:46.860
It's not like no one wants you.

23:47.820 --> 23:49.420
There are plenty of eligible single men,

23:49.420 --> 23:50.140
and they're all good.

23:50.140 --> 23:51.555
You don't consider any of them,

23:51.620 --> 23:53.666
yet you insist on getting
involved with married men.

23:54.260 --> 23:56.380
It was well-intentioned
but had a bad outcome.

23:56.577 --> 23:58.066
Can't you show me a little sympathy?

23:58.900 --> 23:59.980
I'm afraid one day

23:59.980 --> 24:01.911
I'll get pushed down
the stairs with you.

24:01.980 --> 24:03.300
That won't happen. Don't worry.

24:04.740 --> 24:06.540
Tomorrow, once I see Lawyer Bei,

24:06.620 --> 24:08.755
I'll help you deal with
Zhao Lanxin and Ling Yikai.

24:08.940 --> 24:09.940
Save it.

24:11.260 --> 24:12.688
What did Zhao Lanxin say to you?

24:14.220 --> 24:14.980
Nothing at all.

24:16.420 --> 24:17.860
Up until now,

24:18.420 --> 24:19.780
she hasn't said a single word.

24:20.940 --> 24:21.540
So now,

24:22.900 --> 24:24.060
everything is being handled

24:24.820 --> 24:26.780
by the Human Resources Department.

24:27.900 --> 24:30.260
You don't criticize her
for abandoning loyalty over looks,

24:30.580 --> 24:32.060
yet you're so harsh on me.

24:33.540 --> 24:34.660
You're my close friend.

24:35.180 --> 24:35.780
But she

24:36.300 --> 24:37.420
is just my business partner,

24:37.580 --> 24:39.140
at most a former schoolmate.

24:44.980 --> 24:46.022
He Han has updated.

24:48.777 --> 24:51.111
(Please select your tip amount.)
Give him 200 yuan.

24:51.977 --> 24:53.866
His copyrights sold
for tens of millions.

24:53.888 --> 24:56.340
Your tip isn't even
enough to make a dent.

24:57.100 --> 24:58.300
You might as well save it

24:58.300 --> 25:00.240
and tip new authors instead,
to encourage them.

25:00.340 --> 25:02.111
There are so many
online fiction authors.

25:02.340 --> 25:04.311
Survival of the fittest
has always been the rule.

25:04.580 --> 25:06.755
I don't have any obligation
to encourage newcomers.

25:07.100 --> 25:08.260
What they need is skill,

25:08.500 --> 25:09.260
not handouts.

25:09.460 --> 25:10.733
I've put your medicine here.

25:10.777 --> 25:12.911
Call me if you need anything.
Get some rest. Good night.

25:13.100 --> 25:14.733
Rushing back to read the update?

25:15.340 --> 25:15.820
No time.

25:28.933 --> 25:31.300
It's not easy to get you out for dinner.

25:31.622 --> 25:34.000
But there should be plenty
more chances from now on.

25:46.340 --> 25:47.660
I'll be patient with you.

25:48.660 --> 25:49.980
You'll come around, Ling Yikai.

25:55.180 --> 25:55.860
Kiss me.

26:01.580 --> 26:02.940
You said you have patience.

26:03.311 --> 26:04.711
Can't you wait a little longer?

26:04.820 --> 26:06.100
Since this is a partnership,

26:06.100 --> 26:07.580
I've already shown my sincerity.

26:08.220 --> 26:09.380
You should show some too.

26:09.777 --> 26:11.555
Otherwise, where do we even begin?

26:24.860 --> 26:25.660
I meant here.

26:54.666 --> 26:55.711
That's enough, right?

26:59.140 --> 27:00.340
You need me, Ling Yikai,

27:01.540 --> 27:02.660
more than I need you.

27:05.140 --> 27:06.340
Let's go. Take me home.

27:51.260 --> 27:52.260
Zhanqiao, look.

27:52.460 --> 27:53.933
Written by He Han's girlfriend.

27:55.300 --> 27:56.020
I saw it.

28:00.900 --> 28:03.460
♪I keep asking myself♪

28:05.340 --> 28:08.820
♪What it is I should become♪

28:17.220 --> 28:20.860
(Rating: 1 star)

28:28.140 --> 28:31.220
♪Like a drifting dandelion♪

28:32.820 --> 28:36.020
♪Turning where it drifts♪

28:36.780 --> 28:41.860
♪Into soil where it can grow♪

28:43.700 --> 28:46.700
♪When the rain comes, I hide♪

28:47.580 --> 28:50.580
♪In a flower shop at the corner♪

28:51.140 --> 28:57.060
♪Even spring borrows its fragrance♪

29:58.622 --> 29:59.600
Good morning, Ms. Lin.

29:59.740 --> 30:00.100
Morning.

30:13.420 --> 30:18.060
(Resignation Letter)

30:23.780 --> 30:28.020
(Resignation Letter)

30:34.740 --> 30:35.180
Bo.

30:38.800 --> 30:39.822
Call a meeting now

30:39.888 --> 30:42.222
for all editors who haven't
submitted resignation letters.

30:44.060 --> 30:45.660
I submitted mine, too.

30:49.180 --> 30:49.660
Why?

30:50.060 --> 30:51.940
Mr. Zhao said he
wants me to be an editor.

30:55.460 --> 30:56.666
You want to be an editor?

30:58.260 --> 30:59.420
I mentioned it to you before.

30:59.860 --> 31:00.977
You may have forgotten.

31:01.180 --> 31:02.800
You don't really pay attention to us.

31:03.020 --> 31:04.500
Maybe you've been too busy with work.

31:06.740 --> 31:07.220
I'm sorry.

31:07.500 --> 31:08.711
I really don't remember.

31:09.940 --> 31:10.900
But your resignation

31:10.900 --> 31:11.940
hasn't been approved yet.

31:12.340 --> 31:13.580
You're still my assistant.

31:14.020 --> 31:14.820
Do as I say.

31:36.260 --> 31:36.860
Nine.

31:38.020 --> 31:38.940
Better than I expected.

31:39.220 --> 31:40.380
Including me, that makes ten.

31:40.940 --> 31:41.660
Not too few.

31:42.700 --> 31:43.688
Take a look at this.

31:45.060 --> 31:45.980
Right now,

31:45.980 --> 31:47.660
we have over 300 new authors.

31:48.060 --> 31:49.220
With ten editors,

31:49.220 --> 31:50.820
that means each person

31:50.820 --> 31:52.177
is responsible for 34 authors.

31:52.266 --> 31:53.866
That's basically impossible.

31:54.111 --> 31:55.340
We're already in the process

31:55.340 --> 31:56.622
of recruiting new editors,

31:56.980 --> 31:58.020
but it will take some time.

31:58.700 --> 31:59.860
My current plan

32:00.377 --> 32:02.311
is to drop some of
the lower-tier authors.

32:03.222 --> 32:05.266
Some of them started
with us from the beginning.

32:05.311 --> 32:07.410
If they don't have what it takes,
they have to go.

32:07.422 --> 32:09.060
Many of those who left today

32:09.140 --> 32:11.088
also joined us
right after graduation, right?

32:13.860 --> 32:14.340
Ms. Lin,

32:14.622 --> 32:16.755
cutting the lower-tier authors
isn't the solution.

32:16.940 --> 32:19.010
First, some authors have potential.

32:19.010 --> 32:20.060
They're still on the rise.

32:20.380 --> 32:21.140
Cutting them

32:21.140 --> 32:22.620
means cutting off future growth.

32:22.780 --> 32:23.140
Second,

32:23.460 --> 32:24.020
top authors

32:24.020 --> 32:25.555
require more of our time and effort.

32:25.580 --> 32:27.700
Right now, even one editor
handling two top authors

32:27.940 --> 32:29.140
is already stretched.

32:29.140 --> 32:30.700
In that case,

32:31.022 --> 32:32.222
with the nine of us,

32:32.340 --> 32:34.220
we can keep at most around 20 authors.

32:34.377 --> 32:35.622
I'll make the selection.

32:37.180 --> 32:38.380
The authors we have

32:38.380 --> 32:40.400
have different levels
of connection with us.

32:40.740 --> 32:42.580
You can't just
terminate contracts like that.

32:42.844 --> 32:44.511
We have to weigh the pros and cons.

32:44.700 --> 32:46.860
If it affects
our reputation in the industry,

32:47.222 --> 32:49.466
it'll be hard to work
with them again in the future.

32:55.220 --> 32:56.100
Let results speak.

32:58.740 --> 32:59.820
Not relationships.

33:01.260 --> 33:03.020
If we're still relying
on personal ties now,

33:03.466 --> 33:05.100
it will only get harder going forward.

33:05.460 --> 33:06.900
But we're all sitting here today

33:07.540 --> 33:08.860
because we considered those ties.

33:18.380 --> 33:19.500
Thank you, everyone.

33:19.888 --> 33:22.111
I'll start by making a list
based on hard metrics.

33:22.300 --> 33:23.540
If there are any further issues,

33:23.933 --> 33:25.511
I'll handle them individually.

33:48.940 --> 33:49.620
The water's full.

33:53.422 --> 33:55.090
Came up here just to see me
make a fool of myself?

33:55.100 --> 33:56.660
Come on, I just passed by.

33:57.420 --> 33:58.740
You don't look too good.

33:59.820 --> 34:02.140
Who is number one on your side now,
besides Hong Qigong?

34:02.150 --> 34:03.730
And she's surely
signing with Zhao Lanxin.

34:03.740 --> 34:04.933
I won't believe it again.

34:07.020 --> 34:08.100
It's real this time.

34:09.140 --> 34:10.660
Lin Zhanqiao, think of something.

34:10.880 --> 34:13.266
Other than Hong Qigong, you
don't have anyone who can compete.

34:13.340 --> 34:14.140
If this keeps up,

34:14.140 --> 34:16.155
you won't even catch up to me barefoot.

34:25.620 --> 34:26.622
So you've given up?

34:27.820 --> 34:28.140
Fine.

34:29.180 --> 34:30.860
I like seeing that look on your face,

34:30.940 --> 34:32.533
gritting your teeth as you lose to me.

34:33.111 --> 34:34.822
Don't forget to check my update tonight.

34:43.777 --> 34:46.266
Hong Qigong is negotiating
a contract with Zhao Lanxin.

35:04.540 --> 35:05.460
Did you come here

35:05.460 --> 35:06.460
just to tell me that?

35:07.940 --> 35:08.500
What else?

35:08.888 --> 35:09.888
I care about you.

35:36.977 --> 35:38.300
Mr. Ling, take a look at this.

35:39.060 --> 35:39.460
Ms. Lin.

35:40.333 --> 35:41.490
Does this need to be revised?

35:42.100 --> 35:43.020
Who signed this before?

35:44.100 --> 35:44.540
Ms. Lin.

35:46.500 --> 35:46.820
Alright.

35:47.700 --> 35:48.380
No issues.

35:49.220 --> 35:50.020
What about this one?

35:50.540 --> 35:51.600
Where is Zhao Lanxin?

35:53.400 --> 35:54.820
She's already completed her handover.

35:54.820 --> 35:56.222
She's taken a few days of sick leave.

35:56.300 --> 35:57.511
Is she avoiding me on purpose?

35:57.700 --> 35:58.780
It would be awkward to meet.

35:59.260 --> 36:00.420
She poached Hong Qigong?

36:00.620 --> 36:02.288
I still don't know how their talks went.

36:02.660 --> 36:03.500
When are you leaving?

36:04.300 --> 36:06.990
Tomorrow. Equity transfer has been
completed according to the procedures.

36:07.060 --> 36:08.244
Have you completed the handover

36:08.250 --> 36:09.850
for Zhiyuan Investment's
connections and progress?

36:09.860 --> 36:10.380
No need.

36:10.660 --> 36:12.444
Their funding won't go
to Chenxing anymore.

36:12.666 --> 36:14.688
I'll be taking both
the money and the connections.

36:14.780 --> 36:17.333
Otherwise, how do you think
I could start a company outside?

36:19.100 --> 36:20.500
Chenxing's past business foundation

36:20.860 --> 36:22.300
isn't something your startup

36:22.300 --> 36:23.060
can compare to.

36:23.220 --> 36:24.622
You said it yourself, it's the past.

36:24.660 --> 36:27.311
Even married couples go
their separate ways in tough times,

36:27.422 --> 36:29.488
let alone colleagues.

36:30.580 --> 36:32.580
Investors look
at the future, not the past.

36:33.260 --> 36:34.311
Let me put it this way.

36:35.180 --> 36:35.700
He Han

36:35.940 --> 36:38.500
is Chenxing's past, present, and future.

36:38.700 --> 36:39.820
I'm sorry, but you're not.

36:40.020 --> 36:41.244
When I run a company,

36:41.500 --> 36:43.580
a strong author isn't just He Han.

36:44.022 --> 36:46.000
And the market
doesn't rely on just one author.

36:46.066 --> 36:46.955
Do you have one now?

36:48.220 --> 36:49.020
If not,

36:49.220 --> 36:51.533
you need to give everyone
in the company, including me,

36:52.380 --> 36:53.660
a reason to keep betting on you.

36:56.533 --> 36:58.466
Anyone who leaves without consulting me

36:58.800 --> 37:00.533
doesn't deserve to hear my reasons.

37:00.820 --> 37:01.700
And Ling Yikai,

37:02.780 --> 37:03.500
don't really think

37:03.500 --> 37:04.980
you can control Zhao Lanxin.

37:05.333 --> 37:07.022
I've worked with her for seven years.

37:07.460 --> 37:08.740
We knew each other in university.

37:09.355 --> 37:11.422
Zhou Mei was her
classmate for four years.

37:12.133 --> 37:13.688
I know her better than you.

37:53.180 --> 37:54.540
I'm with Zhao Lanxin right now.

37:54.933 --> 37:56.888
Do you want to join us
for a schoolmate lunch?

38:00.533 --> 38:02.177
I was planning to ask you out

38:02.180 --> 38:03.511
after I officially leave Chenxing.

38:04.340 --> 38:05.420
It's for personal reasons

38:05.420 --> 38:07.044
that I've decided to leave Chenxing

38:07.088 --> 38:08.500
and start a business with Ling Yikai.

38:08.580 --> 38:10.155
It's not convenient
to say at the company.

38:11.940 --> 38:13.340
Did Ling Yikai make you feel

38:13.540 --> 38:15.377
like you had a chance
to be his girlfriend?

38:15.660 --> 38:16.060
Yes.

38:16.600 --> 38:17.688
And you believed that?

38:20.260 --> 38:21.780
Everyone knows I like Ling Yikai.

38:22.860 --> 38:23.900
My conditions aren't great.

38:24.244 --> 38:25.200
Not compared to you.

38:26.860 --> 38:28.060
Zhou Mei, you're his ex.

38:28.660 --> 38:30.100
He could live or die for you,

38:30.740 --> 38:31.740
yet you still dumped him.

38:32.266 --> 38:34.644
Lin Zhanqiao, you have
influence in the industry.

38:34.780 --> 38:35.888
You made He Han famous.

38:36.060 --> 38:36.860
He doesn't like you,

38:37.740 --> 38:39.311
but he could still show you affection

38:39.420 --> 38:40.533
and even propose to you.

38:43.060 --> 38:44.140
He's capable of that.

38:45.380 --> 38:46.500
But what if you said yes?

38:47.888 --> 38:48.820
I'm not like you two.

38:49.066 --> 38:50.377
So I don't have that chance.

38:51.044 --> 38:52.733
What's so great about Ling Yikai

38:53.044 --> 38:54.533
that makes you feel he's the one?

38:59.740 --> 39:00.820
People always aim higher.

39:01.380 --> 39:02.580
If I'm getting married, I'll

39:02.580 --> 39:04.488
choose someone
with better conditions than I have.

39:04.700 --> 39:06.911
The ones with better
conditions are hard to handle.

39:07.155 --> 39:09.466
Whether it's Ling Yikai or anyone else,
it's the same.

39:10.060 --> 39:11.460
The ones too good, I can't reach.

39:12.220 --> 39:13.500
The ones not so good

39:13.888 --> 39:15.977
are often more
calculating in my experience.

39:16.177 --> 39:17.933
I don't need to suffer on both sides.

39:18.860 --> 39:20.500
Among the men I can reach,

39:20.520 --> 39:22.200
Ling Yikai has
the best overall conditions.

39:23.288 --> 39:24.733
He has one more advantage.

39:25.500 --> 39:27.140
He doesn't hide his ambition.

39:27.177 --> 39:29.400
Everything, good or bad,
is laid out in the open.

39:30.022 --> 39:32.288
In that sense, he's better
than many hypocrites.

39:33.044 --> 39:34.733
No matter how good the conditions are,

39:35.500 --> 39:36.460
if he doesn't like you,

39:38.000 --> 39:40.133
isn't it just marrying
for the sake of marriage?

39:43.422 --> 39:45.060
How many people actually marry for love?

39:45.511 --> 39:47.733
And even if they do,
does it guarantee happiness?

39:49.180 --> 39:50.300
Marriage is meant

39:50.300 --> 39:51.540
to improve the quality of life.

39:58.540 --> 39:59.340
You're my friend.

40:00.340 --> 40:01.740
I know this isn't very loyal,

40:02.133 --> 40:03.420
but the opportunity is rare.

40:04.020 --> 40:04.740
I want to try.

40:07.300 --> 40:08.111
I understand.

40:09.022 --> 40:10.540
But we're not really friends anymore.

40:11.980 --> 40:14.180
Once he stabilizes
and finds new support,

40:14.460 --> 40:15.460
he'll drop you.

40:18.020 --> 40:19.580
It'll depend on my own ability.

40:20.420 --> 40:21.380
Why put yourself

40:21.380 --> 40:22.180
in such a passive

40:22.180 --> 40:23.580
and exhausting situation?

40:24.260 --> 40:25.220
Aren't you the same?

40:25.555 --> 40:27.422
Going after married men again and again.

40:27.700 --> 40:29.340
Aren't you passive?
Aren't you exhausted?

40:30.111 --> 40:31.220
When people talk about you,

40:31.220 --> 40:33.220
it's probably harsher
than what you say about me.

40:33.740 --> 40:35.688
But everyone has
their own reasons, right?

40:36.860 --> 40:37.900
Zhanqiao, aren't you tired?

40:38.660 --> 40:40.260
All these years, working for He Han.

40:40.540 --> 40:41.860
He earns millions in royalties.

40:41.977 --> 40:44.180
Aside from what you're owed,
what has he given you?

40:44.580 --> 40:45.860
He wouldn't even spare

40:45.860 --> 40:47.220
a place for your toothbrush.

40:48.488 --> 40:50.111
Only half a month after breaking up,

40:50.200 --> 40:51.300
he's already out in public

40:51.300 --> 40:53.420
with whatever new girlfriend he has.

40:54.333 --> 40:55.540
When you were together,

40:55.540 --> 40:56.540
there was love, right?

40:57.420 --> 40:58.460
Yet it ended up even worse.

41:01.244 --> 41:02.644
Excuse me, the bill, please.

41:02.860 --> 41:03.580
Yes, one moment.

41:03.977 --> 41:04.770
Let's split it.

41:04.770 --> 41:07.377
I don't think we'll have another chance
to sit down for a meal again.

41:08.060 --> 41:09.860
How did you convince Hong Qigong

41:09.860 --> 41:11.020
to sign with you?

41:12.060 --> 41:14.140
For someone like her,

41:14.755 --> 41:16.577
a new company isn't the best choice.

41:18.820 --> 41:19.820
We offered more money.

41:20.780 --> 41:22.300
Everything else is just an excuse.

41:23.355 --> 41:25.420
She always thought
the previous offer was too low.

41:25.911 --> 41:26.977
This contract price

41:27.180 --> 41:28.460
was only finalized today.

41:40.860 --> 41:41.820
So Hong Qigong

41:41.820 --> 41:43.740
showed you
what "life is like a show" is.

41:43.822 --> 41:45.622
She made sure
she wouldn't lose either way.

41:45.688 --> 41:47.422
Now that she's signed with Zhao Lanxin,

41:47.540 --> 41:49.700
she can say she left
because you didn't trust her.

41:50.460 --> 41:52.100
If Zhao Lanxin doesn't pay enough,

41:52.260 --> 41:54.140
she can turn around and say
she's loyal to you.

41:55.420 --> 41:56.740
So He Han wasn't wrong.

42:04.660 --> 42:07.380
(Funding Allocation Plan,
Chenxing Culture Media Co., Ltd.)

42:09.180 --> 42:09.700
Done?

42:11.340 --> 42:12.500
Ling Yikai intercepted it.

42:14.100 --> 42:15.100
So once he leaves,

42:15.180 --> 42:18.000
the company's investment side
will be left without leadership.

42:18.260 --> 42:19.740
That's why I had to ask for your help.

42:20.460 --> 42:23.900
I'm ashamed
I ever dated someone like that.

42:24.044 --> 42:25.822
Haven't you dated enough jerks already?

42:28.420 --> 42:29.940
Check the time. What's going on?

42:29.940 --> 42:30.620
It's 3:10 PM.

42:31.333 --> 42:32.100
Good day, Ms. Lin.

42:32.222 --> 42:33.180
Updates stopped.

42:33.740 --> 42:34.180
Ms. Lin.

42:34.888 --> 42:35.940
What are you looking at?

42:36.000 --> 42:38.219
He Han's Shattered Six States
will be paused for a week.

42:38.220 --> 42:39.111
It was just posted.

42:40.755 --> 42:42.977
Ms. Lin, Shattered Six States
is pausing for a week.

42:43.020 --> 42:44.666
Ms. Lin, He Han has stopped updating.

42:51.820 --> 42:52.740
Hello!

42:53.020 --> 42:54.420
Today, I have

42:54.420 --> 42:55.933
a very important announcement.

42:56.340 --> 42:57.300
Starting today,

42:57.780 --> 42:59.780
Shattered Six States
will be paused for a week.

43:05.780 --> 43:07.300
This is Lin Zhanqiao. Meet your new boss.

43:07.460 --> 43:09.140
I'm a big fan of Mr. He Han.

43:09.620 --> 43:11.060
Don't say I'm not being a good sport.

43:11.580 --> 43:13.020
I'll give you one week

43:13.020 --> 43:14.420
to find a better author.

43:14.460 --> 43:15.220
If you're so capable,

43:15.460 --> 43:16.860
try stopping updates for a month.

43:17.580 --> 43:19.260
Let's see
if you're still invincible then.

43:21.460 --> 43:22.100
Didn't you say

43:22.100 --> 43:23.420
you weren't going to see her anymore?

43:23.820 --> 43:24.860
We are truly in love.

43:25.060 --> 43:25.820
Please show some mercy.

43:26.060 --> 43:27.940
You're "truly in love"
when he has money,

43:28.420 --> 43:30.060
but when he's broke,
the "spark is gone."

43:30.580 --> 43:32.180
Even streetwalkers
have more shame than you.

43:35.460 --> 43:36.020
What are you doing?

43:36.020 --> 43:36.420
You...

43:39.161 --> 43:40.281
(I've been thinking.)

43:41.561 --> 43:44.841
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:45.601 --> 43:52.931
(is probably different.)

43:53.931 --> 43:55.681
♪If the sky♪

43:56.191 --> 43:57.591
♪And the sea♪

43:58.131 --> 43:59.841
♪Turned upside down♪

44:01.401 --> 44:03.331
♪If a swimming fish♪

44:03.731 --> 44:07.121
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

44:08.891 --> 44:10.861
♪If back then♪

44:11.221 --> 44:15.631
♪We had never let go♪

44:16.231 --> 44:22.511
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

44:23.631 --> 44:25.781
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

44:25.781 --> 44:27.651
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

44:27.831 --> 44:30.271
♪And found our way back whole♪

44:31.111 --> 44:33.281
♪So let this surging love♪

44:33.281 --> 44:37.711
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:38.611 --> 44:40.791
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:40.791 --> 44:41.881
♪That's alright♪

44:42.421 --> 44:43.171
♪If we're buried♪

44:43.171 --> 44:45.871
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:46.131 --> 44:48.311
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:48.491 --> 44:52.911
♪This one eternal photograph♪

45:08.671 --> 45:10.961
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

45:10.961 --> 45:12.721
♪Running in opposite ways♪

45:12.841 --> 45:15.311
♪Searching all along the way♪

45:16.111 --> 45:18.271
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

45:18.461 --> 45:23.371
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

45:23.371 --> 45:26.891
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

45:27.131 --> 45:28.101
♪Only after loss♪

45:28.101 --> 45:30.731
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

45:31.141 --> 45:33.501
♪In another time and space♪

45:33.501 --> 45:35.061
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:35.061 --> 45:37.891
♪Till we grow old♪

45:38.851 --> 45:41.141
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:41.141 --> 45:43.811
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:46.331 --> 45:48.741
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:48.741 --> 45:53.951
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
